# A local copy of a retired mockup, dropped in the repo root to view a page
# beside it. `the-living-garden.html` was DELETED on purpose in #56 — it had
# shipped, never deployed, and its retirement is what caught the guard that
# exempted garden.html from the index rule. It came back in #58 because a
# reference copy was sitting untracked in the working tree when a `git add -A`
# ran, which is the whole reason this line exists: the file is a reference to
# look at, never a file this repo carries.
the-living-garden.html
